<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks rose, nine fell and two were flat in 12.6-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday, with the WIG 20 index closing 0.2 percent higher at 1,619.3 points.</p>
<p>The remaining two stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.3 percent to 151.5 zlotys in a 10.6-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
